{"asset_key":"ep8/quest_story_18201320","episode":"ep8","category":"quest_story","story_id":"18201320","schema_version":1,"lang":"jp","texts":{"say:2:1820132001:1":{"text":"うぅぅ……あの宿屋の人、あくどすぎるよ……","source_cn":"呜呜，诺珐斯的旅店商人好黑……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x7D16142B8B5C73CA","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1820132002:1":{"text":"いったい何をされたの！ちょっと待ってて！今すぐ私がそいつの腕をへし折って――","source_cn":"怎么，他敢欺负你吗？等着，姨妈现在就去把他的胳膊掰下来——","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xB408D7B3327606AA","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1820132003:1":{"text":"ち、違う違う！いじめられたわけじゃないし、うちが相手だからって足元を見られたわけでもない！","source_cn":"——不不不，他没有欺负我！他给所有人的汇率都是一样的。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x24E766560F2AE804","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1820132004:1":{"text":"ただ、レートが思った以上に高すぎたの！うちのほかにも納得できない人がいてね。必死に交渉したんだけど、その両替商は「うちは良心価格だ。三日月通りの奥の酒場なんて、あっちのほうがよっぽどぼったくりだよ」って……","source_cn":"但他给出的汇率实在高得吓人！有人想讲讲价，那个商人还大...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xCAA763AC8CCB8A8F","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1820132005:1":{"text":"そしたらその人、あの酒場にレートを聞きに行くって言うの。","source_cn":"有人不服，当场就打算去月弯街尽头的那个酒馆问问价。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x0C97BEB63B41518B","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1820132006:1":{"text":"時間さえあれば、うちもついて行きたかったわ。","source_cn":"要不是我赶时间，非得跟着他们一起去一趟……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x2C60F2F5D9BD78E7","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1820132007:1":{"text":"ビビア、その酒場にはもう近づいちゃダメよ。","source_cn":"薇薇娅，不要随便去那个酒馆哦。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xD3EC81E9ED4D6200","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1820132008:1":{"text":"あそこは生者の出入りが多く、堂々とブライト金貨まで使われてるの。","source_cn":"那附近常有活人出没，酒馆甚至可以正当光明地使用耀光金币。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x46D719DC7002BCE8","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1820132009:1":{"text":"あれほどあからさまなのに、バンティスはなぜか見て見ぬふり。きっと何か巨大な勢力が裏についているはずよ。","source_cn":"如此毫不遮掩，班题斯却从不管。那地方不简单，肯定背靠着...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xE2F44ECB59A37278","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:11:1820132010:1":{"text":"いい？ノヴァリスにいる間、あの辺りには絶対近寄らないと約束して。","source_cn":"在诺珐斯期间，一定要尽量避开那个地方。记住了吗，我亲爱...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x870E8FA04ABA46C4","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"",